  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network to integrate productivity and occupational safety and health improvements NIPOSH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to development of decent work and economic growth (SDG 8) in the RMG industry and thereby to contribute to the future social sustainability of the industry. The direct objective of the development cooperation is to develop and document a network model for integrated improvement of OSH and productivity (LEAN), and to secure a sustainable model where BGMEA in cooperation with universities is qualified to lead such future processes.</narrative>
  </description>
